 when they change color they become a different object. They come in red (8874), dark blue (8875), light blue (8876) and green (8877). Some of them don't have sparkles and just shimmer: \n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crystal Column 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Column_2_a9a52e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Constructions</li><li>Pillars</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/shadows-of-yalahar-quest\">Shadows of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zirkon\">Zirkon</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["shadows-of-yalahar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"shadows-of-yalahar-quest","quest":"Shadows of Yalahar Quest","step":"2-6","n":20,"title":"Disparar o canhão contra a coluna vermelha","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}